    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="34">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:Ine">Ine</ref> 34</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">{LXXVIII} Se ðe on ðære fore wære þæt mon monnan ofsloge, getriewe hine ðæs sleges ⁊ ða fore gebete be ðæs ofslegenan wergielde.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">He who was on a raid in which a man was killed, let him clear himself [by oath] of culpability for the death and compensate for his part in the raid according to the slain man’s wergild.</ab>
        <ab type="secondTranslation" xml:lang="en">He who has been on a foray, which has resulted in a man being slain, must clear himself of the homicide and pay compensation for his participation in the foray, in proportion to the wergeld of the slain man.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">Se (þe) on ðære fóre wære, ðæt mon mon ofsloge, getriwe hine þæs sleges ⁊ þa fore gebete be ðæs ofslægnan were:</ab>
      </div>
    </body>
